# kotor_walk_opening: the part of the opening route that plays through today.
# New game -> Endar Spire opening conversation -> locker -> loot -> equip.
# Grow it as each stop in the route is fixed (see opening_full.walk).
autodialogue first
expect module end_m01aa
idle 25
goto end_locker01
use end_locker01
loot
equip all
idle 10
end
